"Ctrl+R — Reverse search history Tab — Select autocomplete item / cycle nick "
"completion Escape — Cancel edit mode / dismiss autocomplete / tooltip / — "
"Open command autocomplete (at start of input) @ — Open nick autocomplete (at"
" word boundary) # — Open channel autocomplete (at word boundary)"
msgstr ""
"Masukkan - Kirim pesan / hapus isi otomatis Shift + Enter - Masukkan baris-"
"baru dalam masukan ke atas - Sunting pesan terakhir (ketika masukan kosong) "
"/ perintah riwayat Up / Down - Perintah riwayat / navigasi dropdown "
"Autocomplete Ctrl + Up - Ramban history (save draft + Down - Ramban history "
"forward (reshop reshops) Ctrl + R - Reverse search history Up - Pilih "
"autocomplete item / cyle Explete Eschaption - batalkan mode / lack mode / "
"toolled / toollete"

